@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-login-token
@organizationId = replace-with-owner-or-delegated-agency-organization-id
@propertyId = replace-with-property-id
@unitId = replace-with-unit-id
@listingId = replace-with-listing-id
@listingVersion = 0
@propertyVersion = 0
@unitVersion = 0

### Create a private draft for an existing unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"unitId":"{{unitId}}","details":{"title":"Bright two-bedroom apartment","description":"A spacious rental near the town centre.","showExactLocation":false}}

### List private listings for this property
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/listings?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read current listing version, publication snapshot, and publiclyVisible flag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/listings/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read source versions and verify details before publishing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Source unit must be ACTIVE and AVAILABLE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/units/{{unitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Publish/re-publish reviewed details; source property must be ACTIVE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/listings/{{listingId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{listingVersion}},"propertyVersion":{{propertyVersion}},"unitVersion":{{unitVersion}}}

### Guest browsing - no token required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/listings?limit=20&offset=0

### Guest search with filters; specify currency for price comparisons
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/listings?q=apartment&city=Nairobi&countryCode=KE&type=APARTMENT&currency=KES&minRent=10000&maxRent=100000&minBedrooms=2&sort=PRICE_ASC&limit=20&offset=0

### Guest listing detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/listings/{{listingId}}

### Replace listing copy; published listings are withdrawn until reviewed/re-published
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/listings/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{listingVersion}},"details":{"title":"Updated apartment title","description":"Updated public description.","showExactLocation":false}}

### Withdraw publication; works even when the source inventory is archived
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/listings/{{listingId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{listingVersion}}}
